member.summary:
Builds a : optional strict zlib and explicitly registered codecs such as brotli and zstd.
There is no global registry and no registration at import time (SG-R-CDC-09). A builder is not thread safe;
the decoder it builds is.

Decodes one step. Bytes counted in  are bytes the decoder took from the input;
they are what the ratio meter and the input limit are judged on, so a decoder must only take bytes it uses
(a byte-aligned end of stream gives back what it looked at but did not need).
